# hi again. workflow

Read `AGENTS.md` first. Spec and contracts live in `docs/PLAN.md`. Board: `docs/TASKS.md`. Handoff: `docs/PROGRESS.md`.

## One card
- Do exactly one card from `TASKS.md` (the one Kingston gave you). Touch only its listed files.
- Flip Status: `todo` → `doing` → `done`. End with 1–3 lines in `PROGRESS.md`.
- Commit only when Kingston asks: `"<ID>: <what works now>"`.

## Contracts are frozen
- Code against `docs/PLAN.md` Part 3 exactly. Do not rename models, service signatures, tables, or RPCs.
- If a contract is wrong, stop and say so. Only the architect changes Part 3.

## Build gate
Before saying done:
```bash
xcodebuild -scheme HiAgain -destination 'generic/platform=iOS Simulator' build -quiet
```
Fix every error. Never edit `HiAgain.xcodeproj` by hand — change `project.yml` and run `xcodegen generate`.

## Secrets
Never commit or print `Config/Secrets.xcconfig` or API keys.

## Demo path (never break it)
Sign in → make badge → link card → scan → badge + stamp → People → note on Person.
